OL,3,GNEWSASubstance released at concert
OL,4,Acould be linked to robberies, police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn "unknown substance" that prompted a
OL,8,Fmass evacuation at a rap concert could
OL,9,Fbe linked to robberies and reports of
OL,10,Fjewellery being stolen, police say.
OL,12,FMore than 12,000 people were evacuated
OL,13,Ffrom Manchester's Co-op Live during a
OL,14,Fperformance by US rapper Don Toliver on
OL,15,FSunday.
OL,17,FOne person was taken to hospital and 88
OL,18,Fwere treated at the scene.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
