OL,3,GNEWSASubstance released at concert
OL,4,Acould be linked to robberies, police
OL,5,Asay
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice said that detectives were
OL,8,Finvestigating a possible link between
OL,9,Fthe release of the substance and nine
OL,10,Freported robberies during the concert,
OL,11,Fincluding reports of jewellery being
OL,12,Fstolen.
